      "content": "that's a really strong start. i like how you used the phrase \"undermines the fundamental principle.\" \n\ncan you expand on that part for the next paragraph? like, give some specific reasons why it's actually damaging to democracy, rather than just being an old system. maybe focus on how it affects voters in states that aren't swing states?",
